OL,5,G1100 Couples Come Dine with Me
OL,6,     FThere are silly dances, jokes,
OL,7,     Faccents and plenty of pranks as
OL,8,     Fcouples put their hosting skills
OL,9,     Fto the test in Hertfordshire, in a
OL,10,     Fweek featuring Asian, Anglo-Indian
OL,11,     Fand Irish food.
OL,12,G1200 Don't Tell the Bride
OL,13,     FThe One with The Wurzels: Lotty is
OL,14,     Fworried Tom won't take the wedding
OL,15,     Fplanning seriously. He wants to
OL,16,     Fprove her wrong, but needs to
OL,17,     Fsurvive an epic, cider-drenched
OL,18,     FBristol stag do first.
